SCOPE. This license covers the original work in this repository: the tools in
tools/, the tag taxonomy, the forge score, the browser interface in web/, and
the documentation in docs/.

It does NOT cover the skills this project indexes. Those belong to their
authors and keep their own terms. Redistributed SKILL.md text remains under
the upstream license recorded in CREDITS.md, with the license text itself in
licenses/. Sources whose repository declares no license are indexed only:
their metadata is recorded here, their text is not, and the interface fetches
it from the source repository at read time.
